Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:47:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] flare: read flare-nrt 2.0 status (observation_time,
 provenance)

modules/flare parses observation_time as the event's valid_from when the
producer sends it; issued (dedup key, D-096) unchanged. Adds alert/event_id
to the payload, model_version/data_latency_s to quality, and provenance.
A 1.x payload parses as before. Model card replaced by the producer's 2.0
card; D-098 recorded.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
